loop 9 | Tool=Skill, Args={"args":"Deploy the jebmcp MCP server. The repo has already been cloned to /tmp/jebmcp-check. Please:\n1. Copy it to /home/silimon/MCP-Auto/mcp_server/jebmcp/\n2. Set up the Python environment using uv\n3. Add the MCP server configuration to /home/silimon/MCP-Auto/mcp_server_config/config.json\n\nThe server entry should be:\n- command: uv\n- args: [\"--directory\", \"<absolute_path_to_jeb_mcp_src>\", \"run\", \"server.py\"]\n- Or alternatively: [\"run\", \"--project\", \"<absolute_path_to_jeb_mcp>\", \"server.py\"]\n- cwd: the project root\n\nIMPORTANT: This MCP server requires JEB Pro to be running with the MCP.py plugin loaded on localhost:16161. Please note this requirement in the deployment.\n\nCurrent config.json at /home/silimon/MCP-Auto/mcp_server_config/config.json contains other server entries - add jebmcp as a new entry without removing existing ones.","skill":"deploy-mcp-server"}
